<title>USA: Linn/Benton Counties, Ore., school bonds repriced.</title>
<headline>Linn/Benton Counties, Ore., school bonds repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle Northwest Securities Corp said Thursday it repriced $15.2 million Linn &amp; Benton Counties School District 8J, Ore., general obligation bonds, adjusting yields in several maturities and leaving the top yield in 2008 unchanged at 5.40 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:</p>
<p>LINN &amp; BENTON COS SD 8J, OREGON</p>
<p>RE: $15,210,000* GO BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>MOODY'S: Aaa (Underlying single-A)</p>
<p>S&amp;P: AAA</p>
<p>INSURANCE: AMBAC</p>
<p>EXPECTED DELIVERY 9/26/96</p>
<p>DATED: 9/1/96</p>
<p>CALL FEATURE: 6/1/2005 @ 100</p>
<p>FIRST COUPON: 6/1/97</p>
<p>    6/1	     Amount	  Coupon	Price</p>
<p>    Maturity	(million)	   (pct)	 (% of par)</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    1997	    $0.550	  4.75	  3.80</p>
<p>    1998	    $2.110	  4.75	  4.30</p>
<p>    1999	    $1.995	  5.00	  4.55</p>
<p>    2000	    $1.850	  4.65	  4.65</p>
<p>    2001	    $1.920	  4.75	  4.75</p>
<p>    2002	    $0.950	  4.75	  4.85</p>
<p>    2003	    $0.825	  4.75	  4.95</p>
<p>    2004	    $0.880	  5.00	  5.00</p>
<p>    2005	    $0.965	  5.00	  5.10</p>
<p>    2006	    $0.990	  5.10	  5.20</p>
<p>    2007	    $1.055	  5.25	  5.30</p>
<p>    2008	    $1.120	  5.35	  5.40</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
